00:14:57.510 --> 00:15:01.750
So it's full of vocabulary that I don't
know, I can't import that into LingQ.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:05.610
Uh, it just seems to me that, uh,
you know, once I bought the book,

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:10.000
I should be able to get the text so
that I can more easily look up words.

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:13.575
A lot of publishers make the
