00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:09.060
Uh, but the main issue is to have stories
that are, uh, More comprehensible,

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:12.150
because if people understand,
they have a sense of achievement,

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.230
